=== Session and CPU license view ===

V$LICENSE.SESSIONS_MAX = 0 means named-user licensing (concurrent
session limits are not enabled). CPU_COUNT is the instance parameter
cores and sockets come from V$OSSTAT.

Metric                               Value
------------------------------------ --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
license_mode                         NAMED USER (sessions_max=0)
sessions_max                         0
sessions_warning                     0
sessions_current                     29
sessions_highwater                   161
users_max                            0
cpu_count_current                    8
cpu_count_highwater                  8
cpu_count                            8
num_cpu_cores                        8
num_cpu_sockets                      8
num_cpus                             8

